<Base title="About Wardith — Independent AI visibility" description="Wardith is run by Kieran Smith from the Wirral. Direct, evidence-led work for UK service businesses that want to understand AI recommendations.">
  <section class="page-hero about-hero"><div class="shell about-composition"><div><p class="eyebrow">Independent by design</p><h1>One person.<br /><span>A clear point<br />of view.</span></h1><p class="page-lede">I’m Kieran Smith. I built Wardith to give small businesses a clear, checkable view of what AI says about them.</p>{business.founderLinkedIn && <a class="text-link light-link" href={business.founderLinkedIn}>Meet me on LinkedIn <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>}</div><img class="about-visual" src="/signal-lens.webp" alt="An optical lens bringing one object into focus" width="1536" height="1024" /></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">The person doing the work</p><div><h2>Direct access.<br />Personal responsibility.</h2><p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 39rem;">I run Wardith from the Wirral, working with businesses across the UK. When you email, I reply. The tests, investigation and report are my work.</p><p style="max-width: 39rem;">I spent eight years in operations at {business.founderFormerEmployer}, keeping information accurate across systems that don’t naturally agree. That discipline is useful here: check the source, record what happened, and investigate what doesn’t add up.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section--tint"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">What the work rests on</p><article class="principle-row"><span>01</span><h3>Evidence you can inspect</h3><p>Recorded answers and specific findings. A recommendation should tell you what it is based on.</p></article><article class="principle-row"><span>02</span><h3>An honest stopping point</h3><p>The audit stands alone. If you don’t need more work, it says so. You can take the report to another provider.</p></article><article class="principle-row"><span>03</span><h3>Clear limits</h3><p>We work on the information and website issues we can influence. AI assistants decide what they recommend.</p></article></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="shell process-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">The first business we tested</p><h2>Our own.</h2></div><div><p>Our original audit found enough confusion around the name Noven that we changed it. We published the report, including the finding we didn’t want.</p><p>Wardith is a new business. We don’t yet have client case studies to show. The self-audit gives you a real piece of work to judge.</p><a class="text-link" href="/ask-your-ai/self-audit/">Read the original audit <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
